Aim:
To develop a Home Finder website to search for houses and lands based on location, type, and budget.

Algorithm:

Create the webpage structure using HTML.
Apply CSS to design the website layout.
Use JavaScript to display available properties.
Allow users to search properties by location and type.
Provide filters to select properties based on budget and area.
Display property images, details, and prices.
Allow users to add properties to favorites.
Provide an option to request property visits.

Result:
The Home Finder website was developed successfully to search, filter, and view properties online.
